WEBVTT

00:23.180 --> 00:24.400
Do you understand?

00:24.400 --> 00:26.890
This is the collective 
decision of House Bradley.

00:27.380 --> 00:31.080
So that your father may stand at the 
apex of the three great houses.

00:31.080 --> 00:34.340
That's why I signed a contract 
with Bruno Bradley.

00:35.180 --> 00:37.470
Resist if you want.

00:38.510 --> 00:43.180
If you don't care what happens 
to your precious little sister.

00:44.430 --> 00:45.490
Ow...

00:54.030 --> 00:57.780
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

01:56.800 --> 02:00.010
<b>Episode 11
The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer Resonates with the Past</b>

02:05.740 --> 02:06.710
Where am I?

02:06.710 --> 02:10.200
Howard. Howard!

02:10.690 --> 02:11.970
Why?

02:12.720 --> 02:15.450
Howard, open your eyes!

02:15.450 --> 02:16.970
Howard!

02:16.100 --> 02:17.400
This child...

02:18.110 --> 02:18.860
Ray.

02:19.150 --> 02:21.950
He could still make it!

02:23.130 --> 02:24.700
Ray, stop.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.740
Why are you stopping me?

02:28.990 --> 02:31.470
I think you already know why.

02:32.940 --> 02:33.940
Let's go.

02:33.940 --> 02:35.780
Our mission isn't over.

02:36.640 --> 02:37.690
But...

02:38.110 --> 02:39.420
Wrap your head around it.

02:39.420 --> 02:40.940
This is a battlefield.

02:57.080 --> 02:59.550
<i>Was that Ray?</i>

03:01.000 --> 03:02.950
Ray, do you have a moment?

03:02.950 --> 03:03.710
I do.

03:08.370 --> 03:10.460
You're Ray White, correct?

03:10.460 --> 03:11.180
Yes.

03:11.180 --> 03:14.480
I'm Maria Bradley. Rebecca's little sister.

03:14.480 --> 03:15.700
I see.

03:15.700 --> 03:18.320
You are a beauty, 
just like your older sister.

03:18.320 --> 03:21.860
Both your gleaming white hair and 
your red eyes are very pretty.

03:22.750 --> 03:23.720
Is something wrong?

03:23.720 --> 03:28.000
I already heard it from Dina, 
but you really are like this.

03:28.000 --> 03:29.310
You mean Miss Sera?

03:29.310 --> 03:32.090
Yes. She and I are friends.

03:32.090 --> 03:34.740
That's why I asked her to have you come here.

03:35.390 --> 03:37.670
I'm assuming this is about Miss Rebecca.

03:37.670 --> 03:38.360
Yes.

03:39.130 --> 03:41.840
Isn't she just perfect?

03:41.840 --> 03:42.840
Yes.

03:42.840 --> 03:44.200
She is impeccable.

03:45.010 --> 03:48.070
Even though we're sisters, 
we couldn't be more different.

03:49.080 --> 03:52.940
I'm constantly compared to her,
no matter what I do.

03:53.420 --> 03:57.180
That's why I wear strange 
clothes and I always run away...

03:57.180 --> 03:58.450
from this world.

03:59.840 --> 04:04.430
Even with me being such a failure, 
my sister is nice to me.

04:05.130 --> 04:07.020
That's why I want to help her.

04:07.020 --> 04:09.230
Even if she didn't want me to.

04:10.690 --> 04:11.740
Maria,

04:12.660 --> 04:15.720
I will protect her with everything I have.

04:16.020 --> 04:17.690
And one more thing.

04:17.690 --> 04:21.830
Your concern for your sister shows you 
have a pure and beautiful heart.

04:22.220 --> 04:23.730
You don't need to put yourself down.

04:27.860 --> 04:28.980
Idiot.

04:33.900 --> 04:36.100
<i>Why... Why?</i>

04:44.570 --> 04:47.020
Why am I thinking about that this much?

04:49.360 --> 04:51.210
<i>Because it's weird, that's why!</i>

04:51.210 --> 04:53.340
<i>What was Maria even doing there?</i>

04:53.340 --> 04:55.230
<i>And why was he holding...</i>

04:55.230 --> 04:57.170
<i>Holding her?</i>

04:57.170 --> 05:01.520
<i>I guess it's true that Ray is pretty 
oblivious of his own effect on girls,</i>

05:01.520 --> 05:05.000
<i>and oddly comfortable around them, so I 
already had an inkling, but...!</i>

05:07.120 --> 05:08.480
<i>No...</i>

05:08.480 --> 05:11.350
<i>It's not my place to say 
anything about that.</i>

05:14.480 --> 05:17.310
Shall we sleep?

05:17.780 --> 05:19.320
You're going to stay up longer?

05:19.320 --> 05:21.100
Yes, a bit more.

05:21.760 --> 05:23.210
What are you reading?

05:23.210 --> 05:24.810
Luna Ether's newest book.

05:24.810 --> 05:25.870
Luna...

05:25.870 --> 05:28.290
Oh, so a love story.

05:28.290 --> 05:31.630
Not something I would have expected 
from you, that's for sure.

05:31.630 --> 05:33.260
You should read it, too.

05:33.260 --> 05:35.820
Luna Ether is a spectacular author

05:35.820 --> 05:38.380
who can accurately portray 
the nuances of human emotions.

05:38.380 --> 05:41.580
Our textbooks have more 
than enough words for me.

05:42.020 --> 05:44.340
So what's the story about?

05:44.810 --> 05:47.310
It's about a girl who's said to be a demon.

05:48.990 --> 05:52.380
Looking different than 
the humans around her,

05:52.380 --> 05:54.580
the girl lives her life 
keeping herself distanced.

05:55.670 --> 05:58.550
But one day, she meets a young man.

05:59.210 --> 06:01.640
Since she has never interacted with humans,

06:01.640 --> 06:04.090
she doesn't know the first 
thing about human emotions.

06:04.960 --> 06:06.800
But through her relationship 
with him,

06:06.800 --> 06:09.750
she begins to understand the human heart.

06:09.750 --> 06:11.050
Hmm.

06:11.050 --> 06:13.240
So the demon becomes more human, huh?

06:13.600 --> 06:17.030
But while he develops this 
relationship with the girl,

06:17.030 --> 06:20.200
the young man becomes fascinated 
by the powers she has.

06:21.250 --> 06:25.260
The powers of a demon that a normal 
human could never ever attain.

06:25.690 --> 06:29.280
He falls into despair and 
begins to avoid the girl.

06:30.440 --> 06:33.240
Believing that the young man 
will one day come back,

06:33.240 --> 06:34.900
the girl waits for a very long time.

06:35.590 --> 06:40.920
So that she can understand what the feelings 
she has developed for him truly mean.

06:43.030 --> 06:45.620
Well, that sounds like a depressing story.

06:45.620 --> 06:48.690
I still haven't read to the end, either.

06:48.690 --> 06:52.360
But I do hope the demon 
girl finds happiness.

06:54.010 --> 06:55.330
I hope so, too.

06:55.640 --> 06:57.320
Sadness is such a bummer.

06:58.710 --> 07:02.030
I think so, too.

07:05.930 --> 07:07.880
Welcome home!

07:07.880 --> 07:09.110
Master!

07:09.110 --> 07:10.860
Miss...

07:44.490 --> 07:47.610
Thank you, Ray.

07:47.610 --> 07:50.080
It's fine.

07:54.700 --> 07:55.760
Ray?

08:00.260 --> 08:02.760
Miss Rebecca?

08:03.830 --> 08:07.720
Ray, who are you exactly?

08:09.950 --> 08:11.420
I am...

08:20.000 --> 08:22.590
Was that a dream?

08:40.220 --> 08:41.330
Miss?

08:41.330 --> 08:42.420
Ray?

08:44.870 --> 08:48.590
The cultural festival finally starts today.

08:48.590 --> 08:49.570
Yes.

08:49.570 --> 08:52.680
This is my first time doing something 
like this, so I'm very excited.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.310
Miss?

08:56.930 --> 09:00.220
Ray, were you maybe...

09:00.870 --> 09:02.130
in the east—

09:03.010 --> 09:04.740
I'm sorry.

09:04.740 --> 09:06.310
It's nothing!

09:06.630 --> 09:09.820
I hope you enjoy your 
first cultural festival.

09:10.720 --> 09:13.260
Thank you very much.

09:22.090 --> 09:24.280
It's going to be so much fun, huh?

09:24.280 --> 09:25.090
It will.

09:25.090 --> 09:28.490
Let's go find Amelia right away.

09:28.840 --> 09:31.510
To Amelia's!

09:39.870 --> 09:41.390
A maid cafe.

09:41.390 --> 09:42.500
This means...!

09:46.170 --> 09:48.400
Become super tasty!

09:48.400 --> 09:51.140
Moe moe kyun!

09:51.140 --> 09:52.850
Wow, it's a heart!

09:52.850 --> 09:54.180
That's so neat!

09:54.660 --> 09:57.960
Um, thank you very much.

09:57.960 --> 10:02.020
Please enjoy, Miss Ariane!

10:02.020 --> 10:03.830
Please take your time.

10:08.100 --> 10:09.660
That reminds me.

10:10.090 --> 10:12.770
I haven't seen Ray at all.

10:12.770 --> 10:14.740
Maybe he's in the kitchen?

10:15.130 --> 10:17.250
Wait, don't tell me!

10:27.300 --> 10:28.900
I'm Lily White.

10:28.900 --> 10:30.820
Sorry I kept you waiting.

10:30.820 --> 10:32.350
Wow!

10:32.350 --> 10:33.600
Is that...

10:33.600 --> 10:34.540
Incredible!

10:35.330 --> 10:39.250
I! Can't! Believe! It!

10:39.250 --> 10:41.080
Is that seriously White?!

10:41.080 --> 10:43.340
Really? I love it!

10:43.340 --> 10:44.750
She's too cute!

10:44.750 --> 10:48.210
I feel like a new door is opening for me.

10:48.210 --> 10:49.750
I can't believe you!

10:49.750 --> 10:50.510
Ow!

10:50.510 --> 10:52.660
It's Lily!

10:52.910 --> 10:54.560
Oh, Miss Tiana!

10:56.360 --> 10:58.510
<i>All right, everything is in place now.</i>

10:58.980 --> 11:01.310
<i>I will execute this perfectly.</i>

11:01.310 --> 11:03.020
<i>I am a pro, after all.</i>

11:03.020 --> 11:04.950
<i>And a specialist!</i>

11:08.430 --> 11:10.560
This is so scary!

11:10.560 --> 11:12.620
It's f-fine.

11:14.130 --> 11:16.280
I am angry!

11:19.990 --> 11:22.480
I guess this is it's own kind of fun.

11:22.780 --> 11:24.600
But it is pretty lonely, too.

11:27.900 --> 11:29.700
Everyone's having so much fun.

11:29.700 --> 11:31.050
Don't space out.

11:31.050 --> 11:33.520
We have a job to do.

11:33.520 --> 11:37.130
But my naughty festival plans with Ray...

11:37.130 --> 11:38.450
Oh, jeez.

11:44.030 --> 11:45.590
Thank you for waiting.

11:47.040 --> 11:50.140
Here is your super moe moe rice omelet.

11:50.140 --> 11:51.640
Miss Maria.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.300
Lily!

11:54.300 --> 11:58.200
I knew they meant you with 
that beautiful flower!

11:58.200 --> 12:00.640
You're very perceptive, Miss Maria.

12:01.680 --> 12:03.740
You praised me!

12:04.630 --> 12:07.370
And now we cast the magic spell!

12:07.370 --> 12:09.710
A magic spell? Not sorcery?

12:09.710 --> 12:13.450
Become super tasty!

12:15.600 --> 12:17.070
Encoding.

12:17.070 --> 12:18.380
Decoding.

12:18.380 --> 12:19.590
Processing.

12:19.590 --> 12:21.450
Embodiment.

12:21.450 --> 12:24.520
Moe moe moe moe scatter shot!

12:27.280 --> 12:29.810
Miss Maria, are you all right?

12:30.080 --> 12:31.080
Wait, I can't!

12:31.080 --> 12:32.020
No way, it's too much!

12:32.020 --> 12:33.660
You're too precious!

12:33.660 --> 12:35.090
Miss Maria?

12:35.090 --> 12:37.550
I hate to admit it, but I lost.

12:37.550 --> 12:38.940
What do you mean?

12:38.940 --> 12:41.810
As I thought, Ray's a terrifying girl.

12:42.720 --> 12:45.900
I'm not really sure what's going 
on, but that's pretty amazing.

12:45.900 --> 12:49.020
So that's how a professional does it.

12:49.840 --> 12:52.180
Amazing! So cute!

12:52.180 --> 12:55.960
<i>Have I wandered into a seriously 
terrifying place here?</i>

13:04.560 --> 13:06.400
So, Miss Rebecca.

13:06.400 --> 13:07.770
B-But...

13:07.770 --> 13:10.410
Come on, it's the cultural festival!

13:10.410 --> 13:12.170
You need to go have fun.

13:12.170 --> 13:13.230
<i>With Ray!</i>

13:14.710 --> 13:15.930
What's wrong?

13:16.740 --> 13:18.430
Well... uh...

13:22.400 --> 13:23.720
Miss?

13:23.720 --> 13:24.960
Shall we?

13:42.310 --> 13:45.850
I am angry! I'll curse you!

13:45.850 --> 13:47.330
Eek!

13:47.330 --> 13:48.610
Don't worry.

13:48.610 --> 13:50.370
It's a very cute ghost.

13:50.370 --> 13:52.470
Oh, you're right.

13:52.470 --> 13:54.730
Hey, you two shouldn't be so relaxed!

13:58.550 --> 14:02.570
Thank you so much for spending time with me.

14:02.570 --> 14:05.520
It was my pleasure.

14:05.520 --> 14:07.580
I'll take my leave now.

14:07.580 --> 14:08.400
All right.

14:11.120 --> 14:12.040
Ray!

14:12.610 --> 14:13.500
Yes?

14:14.060 --> 14:18.140
They're going to have fireworks 
tomorrow at the end of the festival.

14:18.140 --> 14:20.240
So I was thinking...

14:21.120 --> 14:22.180
What is it?

14:22.760 --> 14:25.010
No, it's nothing!

14:25.010 --> 14:25.870
Goodbye!

14:39.970 --> 14:41.610
Sister...

14:53.160 --> 14:56.170
White hair. Just like mine?

14:56.930 --> 15:00.410
Maria Bradley, may I 
speak to you for a bit?

15:00.410 --> 15:01.390
What?

15:01.390 --> 15:03.660
At this rate, your big sister,

15:03.660 --> 15:05.590
Rebecca Bradley,

15:06.520 --> 15:07.760
will die.

15:12.650 --> 15:14.510
Rebecca is going to die?!

15:14.780 --> 15:16.430
Master, what are you saying?

15:16.430 --> 15:17.870
Calm down, Ray.

15:17.870 --> 15:19.780
Only if we don't do something.

15:22.320 --> 15:24.730
You're here so that doesn't happen.

15:24.730 --> 15:25.900
But...

15:25.900 --> 15:27.030
Why don't I explain it?

15:29.480 --> 15:32.150
Iceblade Sorcerer, Ray White.

15:32.970 --> 15:37.030
Please, save my daughter. Save Rebecca.

15:43.300 --> 15:44.400
So, Ray...

15:45.010 --> 15:46.280
What is it?

15:46.280 --> 15:47.930
If something's up, you can tell me.

15:48.420 --> 15:53.520
Neither Al, nor Amelia, nor anybody 
else would be bothered, you know?

15:53.720 --> 15:54.760
Evi....

15:55.190 --> 15:57.250
We're friends, right?

15:57.810 --> 15:59.640
We are.

16:03.770 --> 16:04.800
Tomorrow...

16:05.490 --> 16:06.760
It will be time.

16:07.570 --> 16:09.770
The Kreuz will awaken.

16:10.630 --> 16:12.850
You do whatever you like.

16:13.240 --> 16:15.830
So long as I get to eat...

16:15.830 --> 16:18.220
the Iceblade, that is!

16:33.630 --> 16:36.430
<i>Big Sister... Big Sister...</i>

16:43.930 --> 16:45.520
Good morning!

16:46.530 --> 16:47.680
Miss.

16:47.680 --> 16:49.150
I've been waiting.

16:49.150 --> 16:50.860
For me?

16:52.700 --> 16:56.830
Please look after Maria.

16:56.830 --> 16:57.330
Huh?

16:57.660 --> 16:59.820
I'm engaged.

16:59.820 --> 17:02.190
Soon, I will be leaving the Bradley house.

17:02.190 --> 17:05.880
That means I'll have fewer and 
fewer days to spend with Maria.

17:05.880 --> 17:07.200
Miss...

17:07.500 --> 17:12.170
But she avoids me anyway, 
so I guess it will be fine.

17:12.780 --> 17:15.890
She can be blunt, and she has a sharp tongue,

17:15.890 --> 17:17.210
but she's a good kid at heart.

17:17.490 --> 17:19.330
A very kind one.

17:20.210 --> 17:22.760
Yes. I'm aware of that.

17:22.760 --> 17:25.030
You don't have to worry about me anymore.

17:25.030 --> 17:28.250
So, please be a friend to her, going forward.

17:28.910 --> 17:30.320
Miss Rebecca...

17:46.960 --> 17:48.270
Coming in.

17:48.790 --> 17:49.670
You made it.

17:49.670 --> 17:51.110
I'm sorry we kept you waiting.

17:51.110 --> 17:52.330
Let's go, then.

17:53.690 --> 17:57.000
Right when we're in the middle 
of a fun cultural festival.

17:57.000 --> 17:57.830
Give it up.

17:57.830 --> 18:01.090
Stop dreaming and get ready, Dumbpink.

18:01.090 --> 18:02.390
Yeah, yeah.

18:02.650 --> 18:04.840
I'm already done, anyway.

18:07.400 --> 18:11.110
Moe moe scatter shot!

18:13.060 --> 18:16.670
Thank you so much for that.

18:16.670 --> 18:18.430
Miss Maria?

18:18.690 --> 18:22.630
May I ask you for a favor?

18:22.630 --> 18:24.340
Yes, anything.

18:25.840 --> 18:28.700
Please give me courage!

18:29.310 --> 18:30.790
Miss?

18:38.550 --> 18:40.100
Lord Evan?

18:44.110 --> 18:47.170
Thank you for the lovely memory.

18:50.290 --> 18:53.550
I didn't think you'd get her, too.

18:53.550 --> 18:56.240
I really can't let down my guard.

18:56.740 --> 18:57.790
Ray?

18:57.790 --> 18:58.650
Amelia...

18:58.650 --> 18:59.840
What is it?

18:59.840 --> 19:00.960
I have to go.

19:00.960 --> 19:02.690
Hang on. Ray!

19:03.250 --> 19:05.160
What happened to Ray?

19:05.160 --> 19:07.210
I don't know.

19:07.600 --> 19:10.030
Everyone, listen up.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.400
Please wake up.

19:18.970 --> 19:20.170
Where am I?

19:26.070 --> 19:28.950
We are going to break you now.

19:38.270 --> 19:41.200
The party begins now.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.390
The Iceblade.

19:42.390 --> 19:43.540
I can't wait.

19:44.470 --> 19:45.170
What's that?

19:53.860 --> 19:55.760
There're so many of them.

19:55.760 --> 19:58.180
I don't know how far I can 
get with just Inside code.

20:05.750 --> 20:07.690
Butterfly Effect?

20:07.690 --> 20:08.680
Ray!

20:09.980 --> 20:11.100
Are you all right?

20:11.100 --> 20:12.770
What is going on here?

20:12.770 --> 20:14.900
I've seen these monsters before.

20:14.900 --> 20:16.780
Ray, you should have said something!

20:16.780 --> 20:18.100
Everyone...

20:18.100 --> 20:22.070
This time, it's our turn to save Ray!

20:28.110 --> 20:30.100
What is going on?

20:30.100 --> 20:31.490
Big Sister!

20:33.120 --> 20:34.530
So you've come.

20:34.530 --> 20:35.460
Maria.

20:44.190 --> 20:44.970
Albert!

20:46.880 --> 20:48.510
Febris Draco!

20:50.660 --> 20:52.610
Tornado Impact!

20:55.770 --> 20:57.400
Sparkle Web!

21:01.400 --> 21:02.940
Elisa, we did it!

21:02.940 --> 21:03.500
Yeah!

21:09.070 --> 21:10.990
Butterfly Effect.

21:10.990 --> 21:12.620
Explosion!

21:15.640 --> 21:19.340
Your Engram is mine!

21:20.580 --> 21:21.970
Who the hell are you?

21:21.970 --> 21:23.420
Wouldn't you like to know?

21:27.710 --> 21:30.710
Not a lot of prima materia, but...

21:30.710 --> 21:33.290
Para, stop worrying about that brat.

21:33.290 --> 21:34.480
Please head up instead.

21:35.820 --> 21:37.230
All right, fine.

21:42.270 --> 21:43.280
That's...

21:43.280 --> 21:44.810
Ray, go!

21:44.810 --> 21:49.120
We don't know what's going on, 
but we'll be fine here.

21:49.120 --> 21:50.620
Let us handle this.

21:50.620 --> 21:51.610
Ray.

21:51.610 --> 21:52.450
Ray!

21:54.860 --> 21:56.160
You guys...

22:00.820 --> 22:01.870
Thank you.

22:04.100 --> 22:06.400
Your voice!

22:08.810 --> 22:13.720
The name Bradley is a curse that 
was cast on our bloodline.

22:14.220 --> 22:18.100
Because of the massive bloodshed 
revolving around the Kreuz

22:18.100 --> 22:21.820
that appears once every few hundred years...

22:22.620 --> 22:25.410
So Miss Rebecca is the Kreuz?

22:25.410 --> 22:28.910
Right now, she is very far 
away from being the Kreuz.

22:28.910 --> 22:32.260
She can't even control 
her own sorcerer's eye.

22:32.260 --> 22:35.620
If she continues to be 
unable to control her power,

22:35.620 --> 22:38.610
Rebecca probably won't 
even live to see twenty.

22:39.310 --> 22:42.240
Maria being born as an albino was due to

22:42.240 --> 22:45.140
the after-effects of Rebecca 
being born as the Kreuz.

22:45.980 --> 22:47.740
It might not be limited to Rebecca,

22:47.740 --> 22:51.130
meaning there may be some sort 
of effect on Maria, as well.

22:51.800 --> 22:53.140
That's why...

22:53.140 --> 22:54.840
That's why I...

22:56.800 --> 22:58.220
Miss Rebecca!

23:50.030 --> 23:55.040
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

23:50.030 --> 23:55.040
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:50.030 --> 23:55.040
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:50.540 --> 23:51.870
This is the preview of the next episode

23:51.870 --> 23:54.060
